  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut pumpkin into bite-sized chunks (peel if preferred) and place on the lined oven tray.\n• Sprinkle with BBQ spice blend, a pinch of salt and drizzle with olive oil. Toss to coat and roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65151291efd40cb1167699ec-ebd29a52.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic. Drain sweetcorn.\n• In a medium saucepan, melt butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook garlic and corn until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add the water and the salt and bring to the boil. Stir in jasmine rice, cover with a lid and reduce heat to low.\n• Cook for 12 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water absorbed, 12 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65151291efd40cb1167699ec-667785d3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the pumpkin has 5 mins remaining, combine slaw mix, a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil in a large bowl. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65151291efd40cb1167699ec-1cbe1a0c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide corn rice and slaw between bowls.\n• Top with BBQ roast pumpkin and drizzle with dill & parsley mayonnaise.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65151291efd40cb1167699ec-8fd5f878.jpeg"
    }
  ]
